# Tone API Gateway — configuration example
#
# Copy to .env and adjust values before running `npm run dev`.
# No media-server credentials are required: Tone Live uses browser-to-browser
# WebRTC. Signaling state lives in Supabase through this Gateway.

# Supabase / database (existing configuration)
# DATABASE_URL=...
# SUPABASE_URL=...
# SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=...

# Auth / JWT
# JWT_SECRET=...

# CORS
# CORS_ORIGIN=http://localhost:5173

# Vercel WebSockets require Fluid compute on the project. The signaling
# Function is api/live/signaling.ts; no environment variable is needed for it.
# Run migrations/004_create_live_sessions.sql and then
# migrations/005_create_live_signaling.sql before deploying.
